hadiths[15]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1249","Salim said"
"1250","Umm 'Alqama related that when the daughters of 'A'isha's brother\nwere circumcised"
"1251","Aslam"
"1252","See 1245."
"1253","Abu Hurayra said"
"1254","It is reported that al-Hasan said"
"1255","Ibn Shihab said"
"1256","Bilal ibn Ka'b al-'Ukki said"
"1257","Anas said"
"1258","Mu'awiya ibn Qurra said"
"1259","Kathir ibn 'Ubayd said"
"1260","trimming the moustache"
"1261","Nafi' reported that Ibn 'Umar used to trim his nails every fifteen\ndays and shave his pubic hair every month."
"1262","Ja'far ibn Abi'l-Mughira said"
"1263","Ibn 'Umar said"
